section 32 (building control authorities), for the purpose of making regulations under sections 91ZB and 91ZC of the Building Act 1984

1984 c. 55.
								;

in relation to which a right under Part 1 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987

1987 c. 31.
									 (tenants’ right of first refusal) or Part 3 of that Act (compulsory acquisition by tenants of landlord’s interest) has been exercised;

in relation to which the right to collective enfranchisement (within the meaning of Chapter 1 of Part 1 of the Leasehold Reform, Housing and Urban Development Act 1993

1993 c. 28.
									) has been exercised;

in relation to which there is a RTM company (within the meaning of Chapter 1 of Part 2 of the Commonhold and Leasehold Reform Act 2002

2002 c. 15.
									).
